0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 556.5 Tm (Aegis is a security gateway that sits between an AI agent and its tools \(reading email and) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 542.0 Tm (files, sending email\). The agent may propose any action, but every action is checked against) Tj ET
