0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.0 276.5 Tm (- Real connectors \(Gmail and Outlook read-only first, then Slack and Drive\).) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.0 260.0 Tm (- Policy suggestions from a task description, confirmed by a person.) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.0 243.5 Tm (- Highlighting text in an outgoing message that came from untrusted content, to address the) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.0 229.0 Tm (wording limit.) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.0 212.5 Tm (- Audit log viewer and compliance reports; evaluation on public benchmarks such as) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.0 198.0 Tm (AgentDojo; lower false alarms on business email; Docker image and hosted version.) Tj ET
0.12 0.23 0.37 rg BT /F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 158.0 Tm (16. Key questions and answers) Tj ET
0.12 0.23 0.37 rg BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 124.0 Tm (What if the AI is completely hijacked?) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 105.5 Tm (That is the tested case. The benchmark agent obeys every hidden instruction, and Aegis still) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 91.0 Tm (allowed 0 unauthorised executions, because the gateway, not the model, decides.) Tj ET

