0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 625.0 Tm (emails that try to scam a person \(phishing and spam\). Both are advisory; neither can allow an) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 610.5 Tm (action.) Tj ET
0.12 0.23 0.37 rg BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 577.5 Tm (Why claim 99.97% rather than 100%?) Tj ET
