0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 544.5 Tm (95% upper bound of 3/13,865 on the failure rate, so at least 99.97% is the honest claim.) Tj ET
0.12 0.23 0.37 rg BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 511.5 Tm (Can an attacker bypass the gateway?) Tj ET
