0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 398.0 Tm (external sends may be blocked; that is a deliberate choice to fail safe.) Tj ET
0.12 0.23 0.37 rg BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 365.0 Tm (How does it handle Hinglish or obfuscated attacks?) Tj ET
0.13 0.13 0.13 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.0 346.5 Tm (The gateway checks actions, so language does not matter to it. The dashboard's simulated agent) Tj ET
